### Get all posts (requires auth)

GET https://127.0.0.1/api/post HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

### Get post by ID (requires auth)

GET https://127.0.0.1/api/post?id=<post_id> HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

### Create a post (requires auth)

POST https://127.0.0.1/api/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

{
  "title": "Hello World",
  "content": "This is a test post.",
  "author": "<user_id>"
}

### Update a post (requires auth)

PUT https://127.0.0.1/api/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

{
  "id": "<post_id>",
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "Updated content.",
  "author": {
    "id": "<user_id>",
    "name": "<user_name>",
    "name_id": 1
  }
}

### Delete a post (requires auth)

DELETE https://127.0.0.1/api/post?id=<post_id> HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
